      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} Perhaps I have a misconception on how imposter works, but isn't it possible for 'apply on upload' style tools to generate what is seemingly a TOS breaking upload while the functional version doesn't have these capabilities. I was under the impression certain things disabled within the scene would affect the generation when they get toggled on via scripted elements.",
